  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be really nice if we could preview how an avatar would look in-game without needing to upload it. Of course you can test a certain amount of things within Unity and get the gist of how the avatar looks, but there are plenty of things that you can only test in-game.\n\nThere are many things such as seeing how a custom emote will play, how animations will blend, how high your nametag is above your head, etc.\n\nPlus, with the addition of the new safety features, it would be extremely beneficial if we could see how our avatar will look to others that are disabling select features for the user rank you belong in.",
